## Third-party components

This library is built with, and links into its test suite, components that are **not** part of it and
carry their own copyright and permissive licences. None of them is copied into `include/` or `src/`:
all of them arrive through the package manager, so the shipped sources stay entirely ours.
本库的构建与测试使用了一些**不属于本库**的组件，它们有各自的版权与宽松许可。它们**没有**被复制进
`include/` 或 `src/`：全部经包管理器获得，因此交付的源码完全是我们自己的。

| Component | Version | Licence | Where it appears |
|---|---|---|---|
| ETL (Embedded Template Library), © John Wellbelove and contributors | 20.47.1 | MIT | `src/**` and `test_package/test/**` only — its cost was measured before it was allowed anywhere (`docs/THIRD-PARTY.md`, `.github/project/deps.json`) |
| GoogleTest, © Google Inc. | 1.16.0 | BSD-3-Clause | `test_package/**` only |
| pybind11, © Wenzel Jakob | 3.0.1 | BSD-3-Clause | `api/**` only, and only when the Python bindings are enabled |

`docs/THIRD-PARTY.md` states, per component, why it is here, where it may appear, and what evidence shows
it does what we think it does. `conandata.yml` is the authoritative list; this table must never name a
package that file does not.
`docs/THIRD-PARTY.md` 逐个说明每个组件为什么在这里、允许出现在哪、以及凭什么相信它做对了。
`conandata.yml` 才是权威清单；本表不得列出那个文件里没有的包。